# Fork Boundaries

- `splunk_app/` — Splunk-native packaging only; not upstreamed as-is
- `.cursor/` — fork Cursor tooling
- Engine fixes in `scripts/` or `core/` — keep upstreamable when possible
- When adding features, ask: does this belong in core (both Docker + Splunk) or shell only?
